{"1":{"w":[{"c":"أَرَءَيْتَ","d":"ara-ayta","e":"Have you seen"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"the one who"},{"c":"يُكَذِّبُ","d":"yukadhibu","e":"denies"},{"c":"بِالدِّينِ","d":"bil-dīni","e":"the Judgment"}],"a":{"g":"Have you seen the one who denies the Recompense?"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"فَذَلِكَ","d":"fadhālika","e":"Then that"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(is) the one who"},{"c":"يَدُعُّ","d":"yaduʿʿu","e":"repulses"},{"c":"الْيَتِيمَ","d":"l-yatīma","e":"the orphan"}],"a":{"g":"For that is the one who drives away the orphan"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And (does) not"},{"c":"يَحُضُّ","d":"yaḥuḍḍu","e":"feel the urge"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"to"},{"c":"طَعَامِ","d":"ṭaʿāmi","e":"feed"},{"c":"الْمِسْكِينِ","d":"l-mis'kīni","e":"the poor"}],"a":{"g":"And does not encourage the feeding of the poor."}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"فَوَيْلٌ","d":"fawaylun","e":"So woe"},{"c":"لِلْمُصَلِّينَ","d":"lil'muṣallīna","e":"to those who pray"}],"a":{"g":"So woe to those who pray"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"Those who"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"[they]"},{"c":"عَنْ","d":"ʿan","e":"of"},{"c":"صَلَاتِهِمْ","d":"ṣalātihim","e":"their prayers"},{"c":"سَاهُونَ","d":"sāhūna","e":"(are) neglectful"}],"a":{"g":"[But] who are heedless of their prayer -"}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"Those who"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"[they]"},{"c":"يُرَاءُونَ","d":"yurāūna","e":"make show"}],"a":{"g":"Those who make show [of their deeds]"}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"وَيَمْنَعُونَ","d":"wayamnaʿūna","e":"And they deny"},{"c":"الْمَاعُونَ","d":"l-māʿūna","e":"[the] small kindness"}],"a":{"g":"And withhold [simple] assistance."}}}